{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":27570,"name":"hao zhang","username":"hao_zhang","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/hao_zhang/{size}/7824_2.png","created_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:43.606Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e假设，我有50个账户，其中一些账户买了一些金额的ckb，锁定后具备投票资格，那么是否可以发起一个提案，用其中一些账户点赞，再投票，然后盗取DAO资金？，如果50个账户是我的50个朋友呢？或者其他可能性。，那么是不是DAO可以被以这样的方式随意推动提案成功并盗取资金？\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":8,"updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:43.606Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":14,"reads":34,"readers_count":33,"score":91.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":11261,"topic_slug":"dao","display_username":"hao zhang","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":3055,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/dao/11261/1","babel_translations_meta":[{"language":"en","status":"completed","source_language":"zh-cn"},{"language":"es","status":"completed","source_language":"zh-cn"}],"show_translation_widget":true,"show_translation_button":true,"babel_detected_locale":"zh-cn","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false,"can_translate":false},{"id":27577,"name":"","username":"Yeti","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/yeti/{size}/9533_2.png","created_at":"2026-11-19T07:34:27.641Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eYeah, it’s possible, but they also have to have enough CKB to win the vote.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThere’s enough community members here, some of which have very high amounts of CKB who would probably step in an make it hard for any obvious scams or manipulation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThere’s also been a few times already where there’s been obvious manipulation of the proposal liking system by sockpuppets and ‘friends’ which have been stopped.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut it’s definitely an situation that we need to be aware of.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":8,"updated_at":"2026-11-19T07:34:27.641Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":33,"readers_count":32,"score":111.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":11261,"topic_slug":"dao","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":3}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":2766,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/dao/11261/2","babel_translations_meta":[{"language":"zh-cn","status":"completed","source_language":"en"},{"language":"es","status":"completed","source_language":"en"}],"show_translation_widget":true,"show_translation_button":true,"babel_detected_locale":"en","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":3}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":3,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_translate":false},{"id":27579,"name":"zz_tovarishch","username":"zz_tovarishch","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/zz_tovarishch/{size}/8925_2.png","created_at":"2026-11-19T10:15:53.857Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e您好 Hao_zhang, 非常感谢您关于女巫攻击的担忧\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e对于 Nervos Talk 点赞环节，如果对于任何一次投票结果存在顾虑，欢迎公开或者私信联系我或者委员会成员，我将会针对反馈进行核查\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e对于Metaforo的投票，正如 \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/yeti\"\u003e@Yeti\u003c/a\u003e 所说，因为社区有足够多的成员持有CKB，明显的操纵行为也难以实现。如图所示\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/3/3493504db7d14954060d8beaa1b3f0e5961aa392.png\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/3493504db7d14954060d8beaa1b3f0e5961aa392\" title=\"image\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3493504db7d14954060d8beaa1b3f0e5961aa392_2_690x444.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"7v6rGEsi8sYcPG5jAogJCikfAz0\" width=\"690\" height=\"444\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3493504db7d14954060d8beaa1b3f0e5961aa392_2_690x444.png, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3493504db7d14954060d8beaa1b3f0e5961aa392_2_1035x666.png 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3493504db7d14954060d8beaa1b3f0e5961aa392_2_1380x888.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eimage\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1779×1146 164 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/1/1d9218c5f892652f987bb78c80d7bf41c8e8d8b0.png\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/1d9218c5f892652f987bb78c80d7bf41c8e8d8b0\" title=\"image\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1d9218c5f892652f987bb78c80d7bf41c8e8d8b0_2_690x483.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"4dARalCcgdYSevC2Z32mXZR4pFe\" width=\"690\" height=\"483\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1d9218c5f892652f987bb78c80d7bf41c8e8d8b0_2_690x483.png, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1d9218c5f892652f987bb78c80d7bf41c8e8d8b0_2_1035x724.png 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1d9218c5f892652f987bb78c80d7bf41c8e8d8b0_2_1380x966.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F6F6\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eimage\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1800×1260 174 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n2026 年前十个月，Nervos DAO 余额从年初的 71.66 亿 CKB 增至 10 月末的 81.24 亿，增加 13.4%，占流通量的比例从 14.95% 升至 16.31%。即，在过去一年中，潜在的可用于投票的CKB在增加，一定层面说明操纵投票的难度在增加。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e具体到逐项提案，能发现在已经完成投票的提案中，除开元规则投票，其实大量的预算类投票的实际参与投票CKB数量，以及参投CKB/请求CKB的比值也是呈现增加趋势。\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/6/69a2d7704ef0588e46b3ea64bc689f7add9b913d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/69a2d7704ef0588e46b3ea64bc689f7add9b913d\" title=\"image\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/69a2d7704ef0588e46b3ea64bc689f7add9b913d_2_690x469.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"f4v1i39YRqwNrQzk9ORHuWYEHCt\" width=\"690\" height=\"469\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/69a2d7704ef0588e46b3ea64bc689f7add9b913d_2_690x469.png, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/69a2d7704ef0588e46b3ea64bc689f7add9b913d_2_1035x703.png 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/69a2d7704ef0588e46b3ea64bc689f7add9b913d_2_1380x938.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F0F0F0\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eimage\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e2137×1453 274 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/4/4b1169c778021f278d41280f395311e17f2c4647.png\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/4b1169c778021f278d41280f395311e17f2c4647\" title=\"image\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/4b1169c778021f278d41280f395311e17f2c4647_2_690x440.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"aI57jb3PTQzd5yWFC1Is6FbpzD1\" width=\"690\" height=\"440\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/4b1169c778021f278d41280f395311e17f2c4647_2_690x440.png, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/4b1169c778021f278d41280f395311e17f2c4647_2_1035x660.png 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/4b1169c778021f278d41280f395311e17f2c4647_2_1380x880.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"EFF0F0\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eimage\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e2023×1291 236 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e不过您的担心也完全合理，虽然metaforo的投票结果在每一场结束后我作为协调员会通过watchdog复查，确保没有CKB双花的情况，但无法确定每一个投票的账号都是一个实际用户：即无法排除可能有用户将自己的Nervos DAO存款拆分在多个账号中绑定。换言之，增加的投票权重无法确定是否有更多的社区成员实际参与到了DAO治理中。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e此外，如果从申请的预算额度这一维度看，会发现近期大量的提案聚集在数千美元-1万美元这一范围。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/e/ef865a477851edd3e1e778a54500402562862941.png\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/ef865a477851edd3e1e778a54500402562862941\" title=\"image\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ef865a477851edd3e1e778a54500402562862941_2_690x318.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"yaVXObCcx0ZcJ0vqfAqOCKszz5n\" width=\"690\" height=\"318\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ef865a477851edd3e1e778a54500402562862941_2_690x318.png, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ef865a477851edd3e1e778a54500402562862941_2_1035x477.png 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ef865a477851edd3e1e778a54500402562862941_2_1380x636.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F8F8\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eimage\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1679×775 60.4 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/b/ba11499e85d22cf6af59f7f776303283bd87eb2f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/ba11499e85d22cf6af59f7f776303283bd87eb2f\" title=\"image\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/ba11499e85d22cf6af59f7f776303283bd87eb2f_2_690x332.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"qy1Qzzbaa3oeMrHRDWldtwqtAlh\" width=\"690\" height=\"332\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/ba11499e85d22cf6af59f7f776303283bd87eb2f_2_690x332.png, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/ba11499e85d22cf6af59f7f776303283bd87eb2f_2_1035x498.png 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/ba11499e85d22cf6af59f7f776303283bd87eb2f_2_1380x664.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F9F9\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eimage\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1772×853 75.9 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e一方面，这是提案更加务实的表现，但另一方面我也担忧的是这可能呈现了目前DAO治理能力（即当前社区对于DAO治理的关注度 x CKB价格 x 提案范围之间的动态关系）动态博弈后的一种上限。以一个简单的价格线性回归分析2026年的14场投票可以发现，在社区参与治理的关注度没有改变的情况下，提案申请的金额增加、或者币价波动对于提案的通过率影响非常明显。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"md-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003cthead\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e美元申请额\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e参考价所需权重（百万 CKB）\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e14 场历史权重中满足该要求的场次\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e价格翻倍所需权重（百万 CKB）\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e14 场历史权重中满足该要求的场次\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/thead\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e10,000\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e24.43\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e14\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e12.21\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e14\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e25,000\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e61.07\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e11\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e30.54\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e14\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e50,000\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e122.15\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e8\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e61.07\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e11\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e75,000\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e183.22\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e5\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e91.61\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e9\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e100,000\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e244.30\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e2\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e122.15\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e8\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e150,000\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e366.45\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e1\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e183.22\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e5\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"md-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003cthead\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDollar request\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRequired weight at the reference price (million CKB)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHistorical poll weights meeting the requirement, out of 14\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRequired weight at twice the price (million CKB)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHistorical poll weights meeting the requirement, out of 14\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/thead\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e10,000\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e24.43\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e14\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e12.21\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e14\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e25,000\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e61.07\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e11\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e30.54\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e14\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e50,000\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e122.15\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e8\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e61.07\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e11\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e75,000\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e183.22\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e5\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e91.61\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e9\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e100,000\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e244.30\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e2\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e122.15\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e8\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e150,000\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e366.45\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e1\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e183.22\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e5\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e换言之，\u003cstrong\u003e当前社区对于DAO投票治理的关注度已经一定程度上触及了一个硬顶\u003c/strong\u003e，这对于优秀的且需要较大金额资助的项目或者元规则提案，以及您关心的DAO治理安全，都是一个不小的挑战。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e对于这方面的解决方案，作为协调员我会继续尽可能的及时的在各个社区渠道、推特同步提案信息，同时也呼吁更多的社区成员能参与到DAO投票治理中。更多的关注和参与，对于DAO治理安全和质量是最大的裨益。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e再次感谢您对DAO治理的关注和建议！\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":8,"updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:36:09.768Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to